* ERA - RESIDENT FILE DELETE

SYSOP ONLY. Private utility; use the local sysop console.

A - Purpose, syntax and examples

:A
* ERA - RESIDENT FILE DELETE

SYSOP ONLY. Private utility; use the local sysop console.

Syntax:
    ERA filespec

Deletes matching disk files through the resident command package.
Wildcards can select many files; inspect the filespec and confirmation
before proceeding.

This resident command is wheel-protected in the installed package. The
private SYSUTLS:ERASE program is a separate implementation. Neither is a
public caller deletion command.

See HELP COMMANDS for the command index.
